---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import content from '../content/legal/privacy-policy.html?raw';
---
<ContentLayout title="Privacy Policy | Booking Whale" description="Privacy Policy for Booking Whale booking platform. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal data." locale="en" breadcrumb={[{name:'Privacy Policy',path:'/privacy-policy/'}]}>
  <article class="editorial-prose"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="editorial-date">Last updated: November 9, 2026</p><section id="website-cookies"><h2>Website cookies and analytics</h2><p>Our website loads Google Analytics only after you accept analytics cookies. It measures visits, contact dialog opens and clicks on our LINE, telephone and email links. These custom events do not include the text of your messages or form entries. Data is sent to Google and may be processed outside your country.</p><p>Your cookie choice is stored in your browser for 180 days. Analytics cookies (_ga and _ga_*) are configured to expire 180 days after their last update. Cookie lifetime is separate from the retention of data already held in Google Analytics.</p><p>You can decline analytics without losing access to the website or contact options. Use Cookie settings in the footer to change your choice. Withdrawing consent stops Analytics, removes accessible analytics cookies and reloads the page; it does not delete data already sent. For privacy requests, contact <a href="mailto:info@bookingwhale.co">info@bookingwhale.co</a>.</p><button type="button" data-cookie-settings aria-controls="bw-cookie-consent">Cookie settings</button></section><div set:html={content} /></article>
</ContentLayout>
